I18N.add({"← 全部预案":"← All proposals","人改变空间":"People Change Space","步迹 Footfall Trace":"Footfall Trace 步迹","放大":"Zoom in","缩小":"Zoom out","适应窗口":"Fit to window","记录":"Record","记录库":"Library","步长校准":"Step calibration","地图设置":"Map setup","说明":"Help","参与者":"Participant","开始记录":"Start recording","开始后点“手动定位”：在地图上点你站的位置，再点你面朝的方向（贴了二维码的话扫码更准）。手机竖着拿在胸前，屏幕朝上或朝前都可以，顶端指向你走的方向。屏幕要一直亮着，不要锁屏或切到别的 App。":"After starting, tap \"Set position\": tap where you are standing on the map, then tap the direction you are facing (scanning a QR code is more accurate if you've put them up). Hold the phone upright in front of your chest, screen facing up or forward, with the top pointing where you walk. Keep the screen on; don't lock it or switch to another app.","<b>后台记录<\/b>：手机放口袋，录两个小时也行":"<b>Background recording<\/b>: phone in your pocket, even for two hours","网页在锁屏后会停止，所以长时间记录用免费 App <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sensor-logger/id1531582925\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sensor Logger<\/a>（安卓也有）。录完把导出的 zip 放进来，这里还原成平面图上的轨迹。":"A web page stops when the screen locks, so for long recordings use the free app <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/sensor-logger/id1531582925\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sensor Logger<\/a> (also on Android). Afterwards drop the exported zip in here and it is reconstructed as a path on the floor plan.","Sensor Logger 里只勾 加速度计、重力、陀螺仪、计步器，采样率设 50 Hz；定位权限选“始终允许”（App 说这样后台才不会停）。":"In Sensor Logger tick only Accelerometer, Gravity, Gyroscope and Pedometer, sampling rate 50 Hz; set location permission to \"Always\" (the app says this keeps it running in the background).","站在一个你在地图上能指出来的位置，按开始，锁屏放口袋。出发后先朝一个明确的方向直走几步（比如沿走廊）。":"Stand somewhere you can point to on the map, press start, lock the phone and put it in your pocket. After setting off, first walk a few steps straight in a clear direction (e.g. along a corridor).","离开这层楼时按停止，导出为 Zipped CSV。":"Press stop when you leave the floor, and export as Zipped CSV.","选择导出的 zip":"Choose the exported zip","① 点起点 + 出发方向":"① Tap start + first direction","② 点终点（可选）":"② Tap end point (optional)","生成轨迹":"Build path","左右镜像":"Mirror left/right","<b>演示模式<\/b>（没有手机传感器也能看效果）":"<b>Demo mode<\/b> (see how it works without phone sensors)","在地图上点几个路径点作为“真实路线”，然后开始。演示会故意加入方向漂移和步长误差，看墙体约束和锚点怎么把它拉回来。路径点落在锚点上时，会当作在那里扫了码。":"Tap a few waypoints on the map as the \"true route\", then start. The demo deliberately adds heading drift and step-length error so you can see how wall constraints and anchors pull it back. A waypoint on an anchor counts as scanning the code there.","撤销一点":"Undo point","清空":"Clear","开始演示":"Start demo","关掉墙体约束对比":"Turn off wall constraint to compare","扫码校正":"Scan to correct","手动定位":"Set position","结束":"End","在地图上点你现在站的位置。":"Tap where you are standing now on the map.","确认在此":"Confirm here","取消":"Cancel","显示候选点云":"Show candidate particles","全选当天":"Select whole day","取消选择":"Deselect","热力图":"Heat map","显示未校正轨迹":"Show uncorrected paths","回放进度":"Playback position","导出 JSON":"Export JSON","导出 CSV":"Export CSV","导入":"Import","删除":"Delete","确定删除":"Delete for good","导出只包含选中的记录；没选就导出当前地图的全部。CSV 每行一个位置点，带校正前后坐标（单位米，原点是平面图左上角）。":"Export includes only the selected recordings; with nothing selected it exports everything on the current map. The CSV has one position per row, with coordinates before and after correction (in metres, origin at the top-left of the floor plan).","新建":"New","改名":"Rename","名字":"Name","保存":"Save","标定步长":"Calibrate step length","量一段直线距离（卷尺，或者两块地砖线之间），站在起点，按“开始”，正常速度直线走到终点停下，再按“结束”。走两三遍取平均更准。每个人走路不一样，所以每人做一次。":"Measure a straight distance (with a tape measure, or between two floor-tile lines), stand at the start, press \"Start\", walk straight to the end at a normal pace and stop, then press \"End\". Walking it two or three times and averaging is more accurate. Everyone walks differently, so each person does it once.","距离":"Distance","米":"m","用两个锚点之间的距离":"Use the distance between two anchors","或选两个锚点…":"Or pick two anchors…","开始":"Start","传感器测试":"Sensor test","走 20 步，看计数是否一致；原地转一圈，看方向是否转回原值。":"Walk 20 steps and check the count matches; turn once on the spot and check the heading comes back to where it started.","开始测试":"Start test","地图":"Map","选择地图":"Choose map","上传平面图":"Upload floor plan","示例平面图":"Sample floor plan","名称":"Name","平面图用图片（PDF 先截图）。墙线越清晰越好，最好是黑线白底的 CAD 导出图。":"Use an image for the floor plan (screenshot a PDF first). The clearer the wall lines the better; a black-on-white CAD export is ideal.","① 比例尺":"① Scale","在图上点两点":"Tap two points on the plan","两点间实际距离":"Real distance between the points","应用":"Apply","先定比例尺再改墙体；改比例尺会清掉手动画的墙。":"Set the scale before editing walls; changing the scale clears hand-drawn walls.","② 墙体（走不过去的地方）":"② Walls (where you can't walk)","用图里的深色线条当墙":"Use dark lines in the image as walls","深浅阈值":"Darkness threshold","墙体阈值":"Wall threshold","画墙":"Draw wall","擦除（开门洞）":"Erase (open a doorway)","只平移":"Pan only","清除手动修改":"Clear manual edits","橙色 = 墙，绿色 = 手动标为可通行。门洞、门的弧线、文字这些被误判成墙的地方，用“擦除”涂掉；桌子、柜子、柱子这种图上没画但走不过去的，用“画墙”涂上。":"Orange = wall, green = manually marked walkable. Doorways, door swing arcs, text and other things mistaken for walls: paint them out with \"Erase\". Tables, cabinets, columns and anything else not drawn on the plan but impassable: paint them in with \"Draw wall\".","③ 锚点（二维码校正点）":"③ Anchors (QR correction points)","放 / 选锚点":"Place / select anchor","生成可打印二维码":"Make printable QR codes","扫码时面朝":"Facing when scanning","朝最近的墙":"Face nearest wall","出口（扫这个码自动结束记录）":"Exit (scanning this code ends the recording)","二维码贴在墙或柱子上，胸口高度。地图上的锚点放在“站着扫码的位置”，箭头指向码（也就是扫码时人面对的方向）。每隔 8–15 米、每个房间门口、拐角放一个最好。楼梯口/电梯口放“出口”码。":"Stick QR codes on walls or columns at chest height. Put the anchor on the map at \"where you stand to scan\", with the arrow pointing at the code (the direction you face while scanning). Ideally one every 8–15 m, at every room door and at corners. Put \"exit\" codes at stairs and lifts.","分享地图给组员":"Share the map with your group","导出地图包":"Export map pack","导入地图包":"Import map pack","删除此地图":"Delete this map","地图包包含平面图、墙体和锚点。发给组员导入，大家的坐标就是同一套，记录可以叠在一起看。":"A map pack contains the floor plan, walls and anchors. Send it to the group to import; everyone then shares the same coordinates and recordings can be overlaid.","它怎么知道你在哪":"How it knows where you are","Web 网页拿不到室内定位（GPS 在楼里不准，iPhone 的 Safari 也不能用蓝牙信标和 AR），所以这里用的是<b>步行航位推算<\/b>：加速度计数步、估计每步多长，陀螺仪给方向，一步一步往前推。纯推算每走 100 步会偏出几米，所以加了三层校正：":"Web pages can't get indoor positioning (GPS is inaccurate inside buildings, and Safari on iPhone can't use Bluetooth beacons or AR), so this uses <b>pedestrian dead reckoning<\/b>: the accelerometer counts steps and estimates how long each one is, the gyroscope gives the heading, and the position is pushed forward step by step. Pure dead reckoning drifts a few metres every 100 steps, so there are three layers of correction:","<b>墙体约束<\/b>：同时跟踪 400 个“候选位置”，穿墙的候选被淘汰。走进门、拐过墙角时，误差会自己收紧。这是最主要的校正，走得越曲折越准。":"<b>Wall constraint<\/b>: 400 \"candidate positions\" are tracked at once, and candidates that pass through walls are eliminated. Walking through doors and round corners tightens the error by itself. This is the main correction; the twistier the route, the more accurate.","<b>二维码锚点<\/b>：扫码时位置和朝向都重新对准，上一段路径会按时间比例回拉（结束后的轨迹是校正过的）。":"<b>QR anchors<\/b>: scanning re-aligns both position and heading, and the previous stretch of path is pulled back in proportion to time (the path after you finish is the corrected one).","<b>个人步长<\/b>：每个人先走一段已知距离，算出自己的步长系数。":"<b>Personal step length<\/b>: each person first walks a known distance to work out their own step coefficient.","第一次布置（组里一个人做）":"First setup (one person in the group)","地图设置 → 上传这层楼的平面图 → 定比例尺 → 检查墙体，涂掉门洞，补上家具。":"Map setup → upload this floor's plan → set the scale → check the walls, paint out doorways, add furniture.","放 6–12 个锚点，生成二维码打印出来，按地图贴好。":"Place 6–12 anchors, print the QR codes and stick them up as on the map.","导出地图包，发给大家导入。":"Export the map pack and send it to everyone to import.","每个参与者":"Each participant","步长校准里建自己的名字，走一次 10 米标定。":"In Step calibration, add your name and do one 10 m calibration walk.","记录 → 开始 → 在附近锚点扫码 → 正常走。路过锚点顺手扫一下（建议每 1–2 分钟一次）。":"Record → Start → scan a nearby anchor → walk normally. Scan anchors as you pass them (about every 1–2 minutes).","离开这层楼时扫“出口”码，或者按结束。":"Scan the \"exit\" code when you leave the floor, or press End.","记录库 → 导出 JSON 发给整理数据的人。":"Library → Export JSON and send it to whoever is collecting the data.","精度和限制":"Accuracy and limits","情况":"Situation","大概误差":"Typical error","刚扫完码":"Just after scanning a code","扫码后走 1 分钟，房间结构曲折":"1 minute after scanning, twisty layout","约 1 m":"About 1 m","扫码后走 3 分钟，大开间":"3 minutes after scanning, open-plan","手机放兜里、甩手拿着、边走边打字都会变差；拿稳在胸前最好。":"Phone in a pocket, swinging in your hand, or typing while walking all make it worse; holding it steady at your chest is best.","网页记录时，锁屏或切走 App 会停掉传感器，这段不会记录。长时间放口袋请用“记录”页里的后台记录（Sensor Logger）。":"When recording in the web page, locking the screen or switching apps stops the sensors, and that stretch isn't recorded. For long stretches in a pocket, use background recording (Sensor Logger) on the Record tab.","上下楼梯不会识别，所以只记一层；扫“出口”码自动结束。":"Stairs aren't detected, so it records one floor only; scanning an \"exit\" code ends the recording automatically.","数据只存在各自手机的浏览器里，不上传。清浏览器数据前记得导出。":"Data stays only in each phone's browser and is never uploaded. Export before clearing browser data.","考虑过但没用的方案":"Approaches considered but not used","方案":"Approach","为什么没用":"Why not","蓝牙信标 (iBeacon)":"Bluetooth beacons (iBeacon)","Web Bluetooth 在 iPhone 上完全不能用；安卓 Chrome 也不能扫信标信号强度。要做就得写原生 App。":"Web Bluetooth doesn't work at all on iPhone, and Chrome on Android can't scan beacon signal strength either. It would need a native app.","WebXR / AR 空间追踪":"WebXR / AR spatial tracking","精度最好（厘米级），但 iPhone Safari 不支持 WebXR，只有安卓 Chrome 能用。":"The most accurate (centimetre level), but Safari on iPhone doesn't support WebXR; only Chrome on Android does.","Wi-Fi 信号定位":"Wi-Fi positioning","网页读不到 Wi-Fi 信号强度。":"Web pages can't read Wi-Fi signal strength.","室内基本不可用。":"Basically unusable indoors.","天花板摄像头（预案一的做法）":"Ceiling cameras (as in Proposal 1)","最准，参与者也不用拿手机，但要装设备，并且涉及拍摄。":"The most accurate, and participants don't need phones, but it needs installed equipment and involves filming.","数据格式：坐标单位米，x 向右、y 向下，原点为平面图左上角；朝向 0° = 平面图上方，顺时针。":"Data format: coordinates in metres, x to the right, y downwards, origin at the top-left of the floor plan; heading 0° = up on the plan, clockwise.","对准锚点二维码":"Point at the anchor's QR code","扫码时人面对着码站好，不用很近。":"Stand facing the code when scanning; you don't need to be close.","锚点二维码":"Anchor QR codes","打印":"Print","关闭":"Close","我":"Me","<span class=\"pill warn\">未校准<\/span> 先去“步长校准”走一次 10 米":"<span class=\"pill warn\">Not calibrated<\/span> Do one 10 m walk in \"Step calibration\" first","还没校准，用默认值 K = 0.47。":"Not calibrated yet; using default K = 0.47.","看起来不是手机，可用演示模式":"Doesn't look like a phone; demo mode is available","示例：工作室楼层（虚构）":"Sample: studio floor (fictional)","这张地图还没有记录。去“记录”开始一次，或者用演示模式试一下。导入组员发来的 JSON 也会出现在这里。":"No recordings on this map yet. Start one on \"Record\", or try demo mode. JSON files imported from your group appear here too.","状态":"Status","记录中":"Recording","步数":"Steps","用时":"Time","不确定度":"Uncertainty","上次校正":"Last correction","这是一条演示轨迹。去“记录”开始真实记录。":"This is a demo path. Go to \"Record\" to start a real recording.","选这天":"Select this day","演示":"Demo","未校准":"Not calibrated","步迹":"步迹","西入口":"West entrance","走廊中段":"Mid-corridor","楼梯口":"Stairs","手动":"manual","出口":"Exit","{} · 出口":"{1} · Exit","按箭头方向站好，手机顶端朝前，然后点“确认在此”。":"Stand facing the arrow with the top of the phone pointing forward, then tap \"Confirm here\".","面朝 {}（{}） 的二维码站好，再点“确认在此”。":"Stand facing the QR code of {1} ({2}), then tap \"Confirm here\".","面朝 {} 的二维码站好，再点“确认在此”。":"Stand facing the QR code of {1}, then tap \"Confirm here\".","这里是墙，点在可以站的地方":"That's a wall; tap somewhere you can stand","再点一下你面朝的方向（往前几米的地方）。":"Now tap the direction you're facing (a few metres ahead).","需要用 https:// 链接打开，传感器才能用。":"Open it with an https:// link, otherwise the sensors don't work.","这个浏览器没有运动传感器（电脑上可以用演示模式）。":"This browser has no motion sensors (on a computer, use demo mode).","没有拿到“运动与方向”权限。iPhone：设置 → Safari → 高级 → 网站数据里清掉这个网站后重新打开，再点允许。":"No \"Motion & Orientation\" permission. iPhone: Settings → Safari → Advanced → Website Data, remove this site, reopen it and tap Allow.","收不到传感器数据。请在手机上打开（电脑上可以用演示模式）。":"No sensor data. Open this on a phone (on a computer, use demo mode).","步长系数 {#} · 约 {#} m/步":"Step coefficient {1} · about {2} m/step","步长系数 K = <b class=\"mono\">{#}<\/b>（正常步速约 {#} m/步）· 校准 {#} 次":"Step coefficient K = <b class=\"mono\">{1}<\/b> (about {2} m/step at normal pace) · calibrated {3}×","还没校准，用默认值 K = {#}。":"Not calibrated yet; using default K = {1}.","写个名字":"Enter a name","先在地图设置里准备平面图":"Set up a floor plan in Map setup first","已在 {} 校正（偏差 {} m）":"Corrected at {1} (off by {2} m)","开始了，正常走吧":"Started. Walk normally","手动结束":"Ended manually","已保存：{#} 步，{#} m":"Saved: {1} steps, {2} m","没有走动，没保存":"No walking detected; not saved","<span class=\"pill ok\">记录中<\/span>":"<span class=\"pill ok\">Recording<\/span>","<span class=\"pill warn\">等锚点<\/span>":"<span class=\"pill warn\">Waiting for anchor<\/span>","{} 前":"{1} ago","点“手动定位”，在地图上点你站的位置和面朝的方向；有二维码的话扫码更准。":"Tap \"Set position\", then tap where you're standing on the map and the direction you're facing; scanning a QR code is more accurate if you have them.","误差在变大，路过锚点扫一下。":"The error is growing; scan an anchor as you pass one.","中途有 {#} 段屏幕关闭，那段没有记录。":"The screen was off {1} time(s) along the way; those stretches weren't recorded.","屏幕关闭期间没有记录。建议扫一下最近的锚点。":"Nothing was recorded while the screen was off. Scan the nearest anchor.","在地图上点你现在站的位置（点在锚点上就用锚点）。":"Tap where you're standing now on the map (tap an anchor to use the anchor).","这不是步迹锚点码":"This isn't a Footfall Trace anchor code","锚点 {} 不在当前地图上":"Anchor {1} isn't on the current map","注意：这个码来自另一张地图，按锚点编号匹配了":"Note: this code is from another map; matched by anchor ID","打不开摄像头。可以用“手动定位”。":"Can't open the camera. Use \"Set position\" instead.","需要一张有锚点的地图":"Needs a map with anchors","先在地图上点至少两个路径点":"Tap at least two waypoints on the map first","演示结束":"Demo finished","zip 里要有 Accelerometer、Gravity、Gyroscope 三个文件。在 Sensor Logger 里把这三个传感器打开再录。":"The zip needs Accelerometer, Gravity and Gyroscope files. Turn these three sensors on in Sensor Logger and record again.","CSV 的列名和预期不一样（需要 time, x, y, z）。":"The CSV columns aren't what was expected (needs time, x, y, z).","读取中…两小时的记录可能要十几秒。":"Reading… a two-hour recording can take a dozen seconds or so.","<span class=\"pill bad\">步数太少<\/span> 只识别到 {#} 步。确认录的时候在走动，加速度计和重力都开着。":"<span class=\"pill bad\">Too few steps<\/span> Only {1} steps detected. Check you were walking while recording, with Accelerometer and Gravity both on.","{} 起 · {} · 识别到 {#} 步 · 手机计步器 {#} 步 · {}":"from {1} · {2} · {3} steps detected · phone pedometer {4} steps · {5}","{} 起 · {} · 识别到 {#} 步 · {}":"from {1} · {2} · {3} steps detected · {4}","安卓":"Android","<span class=\"pill bad\">读不了<\/span> {}":"<span class=\"pill bad\">Can't read it<\/span> {1}","在地图上点起点，再点出发后先走的方向。":"Tap the start point on the map, then the direction you first walked.","在地图上点停止录制时站的位置。":"Tap on the map where you stood when you stopped recording.","这里是墙":"That's a wall","再点一下出发后先走的方向。":"Now tap the direction you first walked.","可以生成了。知道终点的话点 ② 加上，会更准。":"Ready to build. If you know the end point, add it with ② for better accuracy.","终点已设。":"End point set.","计算中…":"Computing…","后台记录导入":"Background recording import","已生成：{#} 步，{#} m，终点偏差 {#} m（已按时间拉回）。在“记录库”里看。看着像镜像了就勾“左右镜像”再生成一次。":"Built: {1} steps, {2} m, end point off by {3} m (pulled back over time). See it in \"Library\". If it looks mirrored, tick \"Mirror left/right\" and build again.","已生成：{#} 步，{#} m。在“记录库”里看。看着像镜像了就勾“左右镜像”再生成一次。":"Built: {1} steps, {2} m. See it in \"Library\". If it looks mirrored, tick \"Mirror left/right\" and build again.","{} → {}（直线 {#} m）":"{1} → {2} (straight line {3} m)","{#} 步":"{1} steps","0 步 · 走吧":"0 steps · go","步数太少，没有算。至少走 6 步以上。":"Too few steps; nothing calculated. Walk at least 6 steps.","<span class=\"pill bad\">异常<\/span> 算出 K = {#}，{#} 步走 {#} m，看起来步数没数准。确认手机拿稳、正常步速，再走一次。":"<span class=\"pill bad\">Odd result<\/span> Got K = {1}: {2} steps for {3} m, so the steps probably weren't counted right. Hold the phone steady, walk at a normal pace and try again.","<span class=\"pill ok\">已保存<\/span> {#} 步 / {#} m = 平均 {#} m/步。本次 K = {#}，累计平均 {#}。":"<span class=\"pill ok\">Saved<\/span> {1} steps / {2} m = average {3} m/step. This run K = {4}, running average {5}.","{#} 步 · 方向 {}":"{1} steps · heading {2}","{#} 步 · 方向 {} · 指南针 {#}°":"{1} steps · heading {2} · compass {3}°","停止测试":"Stop test","后台":"Background","{} · {#} 分 · {#} 步 · {#} m · 校正 {#} 次 · 平均偏差 {} m":"{1} · {2} min · {3} steps · {4} m · {5} corrections · mean error {6} m","{} · {#} 分 · {#} 步 · {#} m · 校正 {#} 次":"{1} · {2} min · {3} steps · {4} m · {5} corrections","没有可导出的记录":"No recordings to export","{} 不是有效的 JSON":"{1} isn't valid JSON","{} 不是步迹导出的文件":"{1} isn't a Footfall Trace export","导入 {#} 条记录":"Imported {1} recordings","导入 {#} 条记录，其中 {#} 条属于另一张地图（{}），切换地图后可见":"Imported {1} recordings; {2} belong to another map ({3}) and appear when you switch to it","先勾选要删除的记录":"Tick the recordings to delete first","删除选中的 {#} 条记录？删除后不能恢复，建议先导出。":"Delete the {1} selected recordings? This can't be undone; export them first.","比例尺：点两个已知距离的点":"Scale: tap two points a known distance apart","画墙：拖动涂抹 · 双指缩放":"Draw wall: drag to paint · pinch to zoom","擦除：拖动涂掉误判的墙 · 双指缩放":"Erase: drag over wrongly detected walls · pinch to zoom","锚点：点空白处新建，点已有的选中":"Anchors: tap empty space to add, tap one to select","后台记录：点起点，再点出发方向":"Background recording: tap the start, then the first direction","后台记录：点终点":"Background recording: tap the end point","输入两点间的实际距离":"Enter the real distance between the two points","比例尺已更新":"Scale updated","已清除手动修改":"Manual edits cleared","1 m = {#} px · 全图 {#} × {#} m":"1 m = {1} px · whole plan {2} × {3} m","未设":"Not set","2.5 m 内没有墙":"No wall within 2.5 m","还没有锚点":"No anchors yet","地图：{}。打印后按地图上的位置贴，胸口高度，码的正面朝向地图上箭头的反方向（人站在锚点位置能正对着它）。":"Map: {1}. After printing, stick each code where the map shows it, at chest height, facing back along the map arrow (so someone standing at the anchor faces it squarely).","步迹 · {}<br>面对此码站好再扫，扫完自动结束":"Footfall Trace · {1}<br>Stand facing this code, then scan; scanning ends the recording","步迹 · {}<br>面对此码站好再扫":"Footfall Trace · {1}<br>Stand facing this code, then scan","读不了这张图片":"Can't read this image","先定比例尺：在图上点两个知道实际距离的点":"Set the scale first: tap two points on the plan whose real distance you know","已导入地图：{}":"Map imported: {1}","至少要留一张地图":"At least one map has to stay","再点一次确认删除":"Tap again to confirm delete","<span class=\"pill bad\">非 HTTPS，传感器不可用<\/span>":"<span class=\"pill bad\">Not HTTPS; sensors unavailable<\/span>","链接里的地图包加载失败":"Couldn't load the map pack from the link"});
